# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile COPYs (catalog/, scripts/, runner/).
# Everything else (git metadata, docs, tests, CI, local secrets such as .env, job data, model weights) stays out.
*
!catalog/
!scripts/
!runner/

# Never inside an allowed folder either
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.safetensors
**/*.gguf
**/*.ckpt
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx
catalog/README.md
runner/**/tests
